   Full license text: see `LICENSE-CODE`
   Canonical URL: https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

2. NORMATIVE SPECIFICATIONS, CONTROLS & CROSSWALKS — CC-BY-4.0
   Applies to:
     - `docs/`
     - `controls/`
     - `standards-crosswalks/`
   SPDX-License-Identifier: CC-BY-4.0
   Full attribution rules, deed summary, and legal code reference: see `LICENSE-SPEC`
   Canonical Deed: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
   Canonical Legal Code: https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode.en

3. REPOSITORY DOCUMENTATION (`README.md`, `CONTRIBUTING.md`)
   Dual-licensed under `CC-BY-4.0` and `Apache-2.0` at the recipient's option.

